---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Info — C++ Registry"
  description="Information about the C++ Registry."
>
  <main class="content-page">
    <header class="content-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">C++ REGISTRY</p>

      <h1>Info.</h1>

      <p class="subtitle">About the C++ Registry and how it works.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span class="info-label">ABOUT</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The C++ Registry is a community-maintained registry for C++ libraries,
          tools and projects.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is to make discovering C++ projects easier by providing a
          simple, searchable directory with useful information about each
          project.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span class="info-label">REGISTRATION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>Anyone can submit a C++ project to the registry.</p>

        <p>
          To register a project, use the
          <a
            href="https://github.com/cpp-registry/register"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            registration repository
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span class="info-label">DATA</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Registry data is stored publicly and can be inspected, contributed to
          and improved by the community.
        </p>

        <p>
          Each project can provide information such as its owner, repository,
          description, language, license and supported C++ standard.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-label">
        <span class="info-label">SOURCE</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>The C++ Registry website is open source.</p>

        <p>
          You can find the source code on
          <a
            href="https://github.com/cpp-registry/cpp-registry.github.io"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
